From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Codex <codex@openai.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 09:50:44 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat(http): schedule connection budgets and cooldown by
 origin

Limit HTTP and HTTPS connections across download groups and share host cooldown from Retry-After. Retain slots through command and socket handoffs, account for speculative IPv4 connects, and give waiting groups a turn at resumable piece boundaries.

Cover origin normalization, mirror selection, fairness, capacity and cooldown in CppUnit.
